"stat_label">Entries</div></a></div></div></div><div class="header_tabs"><a href="/jam/vip-gw2025" class="header_tab" data-label="tab_view_jam">Overview</a><a href="/jam/vip-gw2025/entries" class="header_tab active" data-label="tab_view_jam_entries">Submissions</a><a href="/jam/vip-gw2025/feed" class="header_tab" data-label="tab_view_jam_feed">Submission feed</a></div></div></div><div class="jam_game_header"><div class="responsive_column"><div><div class="mini_title">A jam submission</div><h1>ゴメスサーチ<a href="https://jade-hpy.itch.io/gomez-search" class="sub forward_link">View project page</a></h1><div class="game_author">Submitted by <a href="https://jade-hpy.itch.io">この門を潜る者は一切のアナル処女を捨てよ</a> (<a href="https://twitter.com/jade_hpy">@jade_hpy</a>) — 14 days, 20 hours before the deadline</div></div><div class="game_right_tools"><button class="button outline report_btn" data-lightbox_url="https://jade-hpy.itch.io/gomez-search/report?jam_id=405526">Report submission</button> <a href="/g/jade-hpy/gomez-search/add-to-collection" rel="nofollow" data-register_action="add_to_collection" class="button add_to_collection_btn" data-game_id="3564225"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" stroke-linecap="round" class="svgicon icon_collection_add2" height="18" stroke="currentColor" version="1.1" role="img" fill="none"><path d="M 1,6 H 14" /><path d="M 1,11 H 14" /><path d="m 1,16 h 9" /><path d="M 18,11 V 21" /><path d="M 13,16 H 23" /></svg> Add to collection</a></div></div></div><div class="entry_columns responsive_column"><div class="jam_columns"><div class="data_column"><a href="https://jade-hpy.itch.io/gomez-search"><img class="game_cover" src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIxMjIwOTA3LnBuZw==/315x250%23c/wKBfNa.png"/></a></div><div class="main_column"><section class="visit_game"><h2>Play tool</h2><a class="button fat play_btn" href="https://jade-hpy.itch.io/gomez-search">ゴメスサーチ&#039;s itch.io page<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" width="24" stroke-linecap="round" class="svgicon icon_arrow_up_right" height="24" stroke="currentColor" version="1.1" role="img" fill="none"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline></svg></a></section><section class="field_responses"><p><strong>ジャンル</strong><br/><span>ツール（2003MP用プラグイン）</span></p><p><strong>使用ツール</strong><br/><span>.NET 4.8.1 + .NET 8.0.6</span></p><p><strong>配信・動画化の可否</strong><br/><span>可</span></p><p><strong>作者</strong><br/><span>この門を潜る者は一切のアナル処女を捨てよ</span></p><p><strong>作者コメント</strong><br/>2003MPで機能するデバッガー200Xがないので​​作りました<br />執念深いホモのごとくプロジェクトの中身を掘り返します<br />使用されている変数や文字列の検索のみでマップの画像出力などはできません<br /><br /><br /><br /><br />動作環境：RPG Maker 2003 + Maniac Patch 240804以上 + .NET 4.6.3 + .NET 8.0.6</p></section><section class="jam_comment_form"><h2>Leave a comment</h2><p class="form_placeholder"><a href="/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fvip-gw2025%2Frate%2F3564225" data-register_action="comment">Log in with itch.io</a> to leave a comment.</p></section><section class="jam_comment_list" id="comments"><h2>Comments</h2><div class="community_topic_posts_widget base_widget" id="community_topic_posts_8878436"><div class="community_post_list_widget base_widget" id="community_post_list_6363386"><div id="post-12879433" data-post="{&quot;user_id&quot;:13316430,&quot;id&quot;:12879433}" class="community_post sidebar_avatar"><div class="post_anchor" id="first-post"></div><div class="post_anchor" id="last-post"></div><div class="post_grid"><a class="avatar_container" href="/profile/vipgw2025"><div style="background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIwNzAxNDg1LnBuZw==/80x80%23/mZd46t.png)" class="post_avatar"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="/profile/vipgw2025">vipgw2025</a></span><span class="author_flag owner" data-slug="host">Host</span><a href="/jam/vip-gw2025/rate/3469522"><span class="author_flag">Submitted</span></a>